      <VERS vnumber="1">Then I <gr str="7200">looked</gr>, and, behold, in the <gr str="7549">firmament </gr>that was above the <gr str="7218">head </gr>of the <gr str="3742">cherubim </gr>there <gr str="7200">appeared </gr>over them as it were a <gr str="5601">sapphire </gr>
