        <gr str="2691">court</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4">Then the <gr str="3519">glory </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>went <gr str="7311">up </gr>from the <gr str="3742">cherub</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">and stood</STYLE> over the <gr str="4670">threshold </gr>of the <gr str="1004">house</gr>; and the <gr str="1004">house </gr>was <gr str="4390">filled </gr>with the <gr str="6051">cloud</gr>, and the <gr str="2691">court </gr>was <gr str="4390">full </gr>of the <gr str="5051">brightness </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD’S </gr>
        <gr str="3519">glory</gr>. <DIV>
