        <gr str="410">God </gr>when he <gr str="1696">speaketh</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">And it came to pass, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">that</STYLE> when he had <gr str="6680">commanded </gr>the <gr str="376">man </gr>
