      <VERS vnumber="12">And their whole <gr str="1320">body</gr>, and their <gr str="1354">backs</gr>, and their <gr str="3027">hands</gr>, and their <gr str="3671">wings</gr>, and the <gr str="212">wheels</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were </STYLE>
