      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="13">As for the <gr str="212">wheels</gr>, it was <gr str="7121">cried </gr>to them in my <gr str="241">hearing</gr>, O <gr str="1534">wheel</gr>. <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">it was…: or, they were called in my hearing, wheel, or, galgal</NOTE>
