      <VERS vnumber="15">And the <gr str="3742">cherubim </gr>were lifted <gr str="7426">up</gr>. This <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> the living <gr str="2416">being </gr>that I <gr str="7200">saw </gr>by the <gr str="5104">river </gr>of <gr str="3529">Chebar</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">And when the <gr str="3742">cherubim </gr>
        <gr str="3212">went</gr>, the <gr str="212">wheels </gr>
        <gr str="3212">went </gr>by <gr str="681">them</gr>: and when the <gr str="3742">cherubim </gr>lifted <gr str="5375">up </gr>their <gr str="3671">wings </gr>to mount <gr str="7311">up </gr>from the <gr str="776">earth</gr>, the same <gr str="212">wheels </gr>
        <gr str="1992">also </gr>
        <gr str="5437">turned </gr>not from <gr str="681">beside </gr>them.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="17">When they <gr str="5975">stood</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">these </STYLE>
