      <VERS vnumber="19">And the <gr str="3742">cherubim </gr>lifted <gr str="5375">up </gr>their <gr str="3671">wings</gr>, and mounted <gr str="7426">up </gr>from the <gr str="776">earth </gr>in my <gr str="5869">sight</gr>: when they went <gr str="3318">out</gr>, the <gr str="212">wheels </gr>also <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were </STYLE>
