        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">was</STYLE> over them <gr str="4605">above</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20">This <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> the living <gr str="2416">being </gr>that I <gr str="7200">saw </gr>under the <gr str="430">God </gr>of <gr str="3478">Israel </gr>by the <gr str="5104">river </gr>of <gr str="3529">Chebar</gr>; and I <gr str="3045">knew </gr>that they <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were</STYLE> the <gr str="3742">cherubim</gr>.</VERS>
